    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 43 of 2022(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) byincreasing the borrowing limit of rupees 4,979 billion to rupees 13,979 billion and insubsection (4) by increasing the service expenditure of rupees 4,222,233,362,000 torupees 13,222,233,362,000.",
