    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      396.82,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      322.97,
      401.92,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 43 of 2022(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.09,
      370.97,
      401.88,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "(1) in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) of that section,by the substitution for the words \u201crupees fourthousand nine hundred seventy nine billion\u201d, ofthe words \u201crupees thirteen thousand nine hundredseventy nine billion\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.09,
      442.97,
      401.9,
      526.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) in subsection (4) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words \u201crupees four thousand two hundredtwenty two billion two hundred thirty three millionthree hundred sixty two thousand\u201d, of the words\u201crupees thirteen thousand two hundred twenty twobillion two hundred thirty three million threehundred sixty two thousand\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      538.97,
      401.86,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "3. The Capital Expenditure Column of the Departmentof Treasury Operations appearing under the Head No. 249of the Second Schedule to the principal enactment ishereby amended by the substitution for the figures\u201c2,019,970,000,000\u201d of the figures \u201c11,019,970,000,000\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      610.97,
      401.9,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "4. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
